{#
  The athlete's analysis report.

  Plan Maestro v5 Track 9. This used to be HTML written from scratch by an LLM
  on every generation, which meant a different design each run, a model call
  spent producing CSS, and English leaking into a Spanish product. The content
  is the synthesis agent's own markdown; the presentation is ours, fixed, and
  free. 2026-09-11: it carries the app's brand now, like the plan and the
  season sheets (see _report_style).
#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Informe de Análisis — {{ athlete_name }}</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 13mm 13mm; }
{% include "_report_style.html.jinja2" %}

  body { font-size: 9.6pt; }
  @media screen { .sheet, .print-bar { max-width: 860px; } }

  .headline-numbers { margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .empty-note { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 9.5pt; }
  /* The synthesis opens with its own title; the masthead already says it. */
  .prose > h1:first-child { display: none; }
  .prose h1 { margin-top: 18px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="print-bar">
  <button type="button" onclick="window.print()">Descargar PDF / Imprimir</button>
  <span>En el diálogo elige «Guardar como PDF». A4 vertical, con «gráficos de fondo» activado.</span>
</div>

<div class="sheet">
  <header class="masthead">
    <div>
      <div class="brand">Power Coach AI · Informe de Análisis</div>
      <h1>Cómo estás entrenando</h1>
      <div class="who">{{ athlete_name }}{% if generated_at %} · {{ generated_at }}{% endif %}</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  {% if headline_stats %}
  <div class="stat-row headline-numbers">
    {% for stat in headline_stats %}
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="label">{{ stat.label }}</div>
      <div class="value">{{ stat.value }}</div>
      {% if stat.note %}<div class="note">{{ stat.note }}</div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if warnings %}
  {% for warning in warnings %}
  <div class="callout warn">{{ warning }}</div>
  {% endfor %}
  {% endif %}

  {% if analysis_html %}
  <div class="prose">{{ analysis_html }}</div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty-note">
    El análisis todavía no está disponible. Puede que la generación haya fallado o que aún esté en curso.
  </p>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="sheet-footer">
    <span>Este informe describe tu entrenamiento; no es consejo médico ni sustituye a un profesional de la salud.</span>
    <span>{{ athlete_name }}</span>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
